# Worksheet

**F1 Core loop**: state `S` object; `rnd(S)`/`ri(S,n)` mulberry32 seeded by `S.rngi`, all randomness routed through it (no Math.random found); `finishTurn()` calls systems in fixed order (production→needs→morale→storm→caravan→clampCaps→newcomer). Score 2.

**F2 Map**: `genMap(seed)` 64 tiles from `mkRng(seed^const)`; `canBuild()` checks `B.terr.includes(t.t)`; `adjBonus()` reads neighbor terrain, feeds `bldEff()` multiplier used in `doProduction()`. Score 2.

**F3 Economy**: chains ash→soil→food, ore→metal via `conv{i,o}` in `doProduction()`; `capOf()`+`clampCaps()` enforce caps, overflow tracked in `S.lost` and logged. Score 2.

**F4 Population**: colonist record `{skill,fatigue,morale,job,at}`; `bldEff()` reads `c.skill`, `c.fatigue>=80`, `moraleFactor(c.morale)`. Score 2.

**F5 Needs**: `doNeeds()` consumes food/water per pop; `doMorale()` applies -12/-15 on shortage, +3 recovery when fed; `moraleFactor` feeds `bldEff`. Score 2.

**F6 Research**: 10 nodes in `RESEARCH`; `buyResearch()` checks `n.pre`, deducts cost; `RBONUS` map read in `bldEff()` (+50% yield), plus `struts`/`forecast`/`barter`/`machining`/`medicine` gate real mechanics. Score 2.

**F7 Events**: 12 entries in `EVENTS`; weighted pick in `drawEvent()` (`x=rnd*tot`); 5 events with 2-3 branching `opts[].go` mutating state differently; `S.evCd`/`EV_COOLDOWN` filter pool. Score 2.

**F8 Trade**: `priceOf()` reads `S.res[g]/capOf` (stockpile) and `S.drift[g]` (drifts each turn in `doCaravan`); `caravan.inv` limited & decremented; `caravanBuy`/`caravanSell` both functional. Score 2.

**F9 Hazard**: `doStorm()` fires on `stormTimer`, severity `1+floor(turn/15)`; `damage()` reduces hp, `bldEff` hpF thresholds (70/30) cut output; `windbreak`/`struts` reduce via `stormMitigation()`; `tryRepair()` costs parts+colonist. Score 2.

**F10 Save/load**: `saveState()`→JSON text in textarea; `loadState()` parses, validates required fields/types, returns `{err}` shown as "LOAD ERROR". Score 2.

**F11 End conditions**: `checkEnd()` win (turn≥60, pop≥12, stock, avg morale≥40) and lose (pop=0), both reachable; `score()` combines pop/research/stock/turn; `showEndModal()` renders summary. Score 2.

**F12 UI**: `switchTab()` wired to buttons; `log()` stores `{t:turn,m}` rendered as "T#"; extensive `data-tip` tooltips; keydown handler Space/1-6; `@media(max-width:420px)` layout. Score 2.

**F13 Dev panel**: `runTests()` 18 real invariant checks (determinism, cap clamp, prereqs, save/load hash match); `runBenchmark()` runs `policyTurn` headlessly, prints `hashState()`. Score 2.

**G1**: `RBONUS[t.b]` checked via `hasR()` inside `bldEff()`, applied every production tick, visible in tooltip. Score 4.

**G2**: `doNeeds` sets `_fShort/_wShort` → `doMorale` bumps morale -12/-15 → `moraleFactor(c.morale)` multiplies worker `e` in `bldEff`. Full loop every turn. Score 4.

**G3**: `doStorm`→`damage()` cuts `t.hp`→`bldEff` hpF (70/30 thresholds)→`tryRepair()` spends parts+fatigue, restores hp=100. Score 4.

**G4**: `priceOf` reads `S.res[g]/capOf(g)` (scarcity) and `S.drift[g]` (updated every turn in `doCaravan`). Score 4.

**G5**: refugee/cache/sickness/blackmarket choices each write distinct `S.res`/`S.cols` mutations (addColonist, resource deltas, morale bumps), not just log text. Score 4.

